<p>&nbsp;The platform organizes its services into categories that include boosting, in-game currency, items, coaching, powerleveling, dungeons, raids, PvP, achievements, mounts, and collectibles. Customers can browse games by category, search for specific services, compare available offers, and select options according to their requirements and budgets. The marketplace displays prices in the selected region's currency, with the European section showing prices in euros. Individual service pages provide details about available options, delivery methods, estimated starting times, and expected completion times where applicable. Customers can also request a custom offer if they cannot find a suitable service in the existing catalog.</p>
<p>&nbsp;Onlyfarms highlights several popular offers on its homepage. The Mythic Plus Three Plus One Bundle includes four Mythic+ runs, with three runs purchased and one provided as a bonus, and is advertised with item-level 311 equipment and a Great Vault reward at item level 318. Its starting price is €9.71. Midnight Powerleveling offers leveling across a range from level 1 to the level cap of 90, with piloted, self-play, and remote self-play methods available. Gear, campaign progression, Haranir content, and glyphs can be added, and the advertised starting price is €12.95. Arena PvP Coaching offers coaching for Midnight Season 2, allowing customers to book the number of hours they require with experienced, highly rated players. Its starting price is €16.99. Prices and availability may change as offers are updated.</p>
<p>&nbsp;The platform promotes its services through experienced players, continuous customer support, and manually completed orders. Its homepage displays a customer rating of 4.8 alongside more than 150,000 completed orders, while other sections show an average rating of 4.9 out of 5 and more than 151,000 verified reviews. The website also features reviews from verified buyers, including customers who praise the professionalism of boosters, reliable delivery, successful rank progression, polite communication, and the overall quality of their orders. The displayed review counts and ratings vary across different sections of the site.</p>
<p>&nbsp;Onlyfarms states that its boosting, leveling, and coaching services are completed manually by experienced players, without bots, cheats, or exploits. Customers can communicate with their assigned boosters through the platform's order chat. The company also emphasizes that it does not guarantee zero risk when customers purchase in-game services, because such transactions may conflict with the rules of the games involved. Its stated approach is to keep the risk low through manual gameplay, region-matched VPN connections for piloted boosts, and procedures intended to limit the information available to boosters.</p>
<p>&nbsp;Customer support is available 24 hours a day through the website's live chat, Discord, and the email address info@onlyfarms.gg. After payment, the team confirms the order details with the customer through live chat or Discord. Customers with accounts can track their orders through the My Orders section, while guest customers can place most orders by providing an email address during checkout. Signed-in customers can also access the OF Coins cashback program and use promotional codes where eligible.</p>
<p>&nbsp;The ordering process begins when customers open a service listing, review the available options, and select the required configuration. For a boost, these options may include the completion speed and the method of play. For a currency order, customers generally choose the amount and delivery method. After making their selections, customers proceed to checkout, enter their email address, and pay through the available payment provider. Once payment is completed, the Onlyfarms team confirms the details and assigns the order to a booster or arranges the delivery of the requested currency or items. When the service has been completed, the order is marked as Completed.</p>
<p>&nbsp;The starting and completion times displayed on individual service pages are estimates rather than guaranteed deadlines. Orders may be assigned according to their queue position, purchase time, and selected speed option. Express and Super Express options are available for certain services and can move eligible orders higher in the queue. Customers can contact their manager for progress updates at any time. If the required service is not listed, they can use the Request a custom offer option on the relevant service page or contact customer support.</p>
<p>&nbsp;For many boosting services, Onlyfarms offers piloted, self-play, and remote-control methods. With piloted boosting, a booster plays on the customer's account while the customer remains offline. The website states that the booster uses a VPN matched to the customer's region. This method requires sharing account login details with the service team. With self-play, the customer uses their own character and plays alongside a booster at an agreed time, without sharing their login credentials. Remote-control boosting involves a booster playing through a remote-access application on the customer's own computer, allowing the customer to watch the process. Under this method, the website says the customer's account login is not shared. Pricing can vary according to the selected method, and the available choices are specified on each service listing.</p>
<p>&nbsp;Account security is an important part of the platform's stated service approach. Onlyfarms acknowledges that purchasing boosting or other in-game services can violate the rules of some games, meaning the possibility of account penalties cannot be completely eliminated. The company says its services are completed manually without bots, cheats, or exploits. For piloted orders, it states that boosters connect through a VPN matched to the customer's region and do not spend the customer's gold or items without approval. It also says boosters receive access only to information needed to complete the order, rather than the customer's email address, contact information, or purchase price.</p>
<p>&nbsp;The website states that currency orders do not require customers to provide their account passwords. However, delivery requirements differ by game and service. For example, World of Warcraft gold can be delivered through in-game mail or a direct trade. Currency orders for Diablo 4, Path of Exile 2, and Aion 2 use direct character trades, with details such as a BattleTag or character name provided as required. EA Sports FC coin orders are listed under Comfort Trade, and the website instructs customers to provide their EA account email and backup codes through My Orders after payment. Customers should carefully review the requirements and account-security implications of each specific offer before proceeding.</p>
<p>&nbsp;The marketplace provides multiple payment options, with the About section stating that debit and credit card payments are processed through Stripe's secure payment page. The website says it does not see customers' card details through that process and displays applicable service fees during checkout. Its footer lists Visa, Mastercard, American Express, PayPal, Apple Pay, Google Pay, iDEAL, and cryptocurrency among the available payment options. The payment methods actually offered may depend on the checkout page and region. European orders are charged in euros, while orders from the United States are charged in US dollars. The selected region also determines the game-server region associated with the order.</p>
<p>&nbsp;Customers can cancel an order and request a refund, but the amount returned depends on how far the service has progressed. The website directs customers to its Refund Policy for the relevant terms and conditions. It also offers OF Coins cashback to customers who place eligible orders while signed in. The program is described as being in beta, with cashback currently ranging from 1% to 5% depending on the customer's rank. Earned OF Coins can be used toward part of a future order. Promotional codes can also be applied at checkout when applicable. The website provides an affiliate program for creators and other people who recommend its services, as well as opportunities for experienced players to join the team or sell their own boosting services.</p>
<p>&nbsp;The homepage features a customer feedback section containing reviews from verified buyers whose purchases meet the site's stated minimum of $10. Reviews describe experiences with quest completion, skins and cosmetics, boosting, win boosts, achievements, and coaching. Customers commonly praise the professionalism of the assigned players, the quality of communication, the reliability of delivery, and the completion of orders as expected. The website provides access to additional reviews for customers who wish to examine more feedback before making a purchase.</p>
<p>&nbsp;Onlyfarms also publishes gaming guides, news, and instructional content written around strategies and updates from experienced players. The guides section includes World of Warcraft content covering gold farming, travel routes, character builds, rotations, equipment, and class-specific strategies. Articles displayed on the website include guides for WoW Forever gold-making methods, travel routes involving ships and zeppelins, and builds for Affliction Warlocks, Restoration Shamans, Beast Mastery Hunters, and Holy Priests. The supplied website content lists several of these articles with a publication date of October 11, 2026. Customers can browse the guides section for additional information and game-related advice.</p>
